### Key Insight

The largest segment contains 272 buyers (54.4%) and is primarily made up of female buyers from India who are interested in real-estate investment, generally do not use loans, and commonly discover properties through online search.

The final segmented dataset is available in `Real Estate Buyer Segmentation Final.csv`.
